    "markdown": "# Android Style PRD — Prestige\n\n## Design Philosophy\nPrestige represents the pinnacle of luxury, high-fashion elegance, and exclusive refinement for mobile applications. It pairs high-contrast display serif typography with obsidian/porcelain surfaces, fine metallic hairline rules, vast negative space, and unhurried motion.\n\n## Overall Feel\nExclusive, luxurious, sophisticated, serene, authoritative, and majestic. Prestige feels like entering a private VIP lounge or receiving a bespoke luxury invitation.\n\n## Target Audience\nPrivate banking, luxury concierge, high-fashion retail, fine art auctions, bespoke real estate, and premium lifestyle suites.\n\n## Core Design Principles\n1. High-Fashion Typography: Pair commanding display serif titles with tracked-out luxury captions.\n2. Vast Negative Space: Allow generous breathing room around all headlines and content cards.\n3. Champagne Gold Accents: Use fine metallic hairline rules sparingly as marks of quality.\n4. Quiet Majesty: Radiate confidence through flawless visual execution rather than aggressive marketing badges.\n\n## Visual Direction\nDeep obsidian or porcelain white canvases with fine metallic hairline rules using selected luxury palette accents, high-contrast serif headers, and subtle metallic button highlights.\n\n## App Architecture Influence\nCurated collections, private member feeds, VIP messaging drawers, and bespoke booking cards.\n\n## Screen Layout Philosophy\nEditorial magazine layout flows with centered display titles, single-column showcase cards, and wide margins.\n\n## Navigation Pattern\nUltra-sleek top bar with elegant serif brand mark and sparse bottom navigation bar.\n\n## Top App Bar And System U I\nMinimalist top app bar with fine metallic divider rule and subtle member status badge.\n\n## Bottom Navigation\nSleek, low-profile bottom bar with fine line icons and letter-spaced active tab labels.\n\n## Components\nBespoke luxury list items, metallic underline tabs, and quiet modal dialogs.\n\n## Cards\nObsidian or porcelain cards with fine metallic hairline borders and spacious inner padding.\n\n## Buttons And C T As\nBespoke solid metallic or obsidian buttons with wide letter-spacing.\n\n## Forms And Input Fields\nMinimalist input fields with fine metallic bottom rules and elegant serif placeholder text.\n\n## Lists And Content Presentation\nSpacious editorial lists with high-fashion portrait photos and tracked subtitle captions.\n\n## Empty States\nElegant empty state cards featuring a single metallic linear icon, serif title, and understated action button.\n\n## Loading States\nSilky fade transitions and subtle metallic progress lines.\n\n## Dialogs And Bottom Sheets\nPrivate luxury bottom sheets with warm rich backdrops adapting to the selected palette and metallic action triggers.\n\n## Fab And Contextual Actions\nUnderstated Floating Action Button with metallic border highlight.\n\n## Icons And Illustrations\nUltra-thin hairline vector icons tinted in soft metallic or platinum tones.\n\n## Motion And Interaction\nSilky smooth ease-in-out transitions with gentle depth reveals.\n\n## Responsive Behaviour\nEditorial single-column layouts center majestically on larger tablet screens.\n\n## Accessibility\nStrict WCAG AA text contrast maintained across obsidian and metallic surfaces.\n\n## Things To Avoid\nAvoid harsh, uncalibrated colors, cheap plastic buttons, crowded dense tables, and playful bouncy animations.\n\n## Style Invariants\n### Must Always\n- Always align with the core philosophy: Luxury, premium, high-fashion typography, and exclusive refinement.\n- Maintain structural integrity and clear hierarchy.\n- Prioritize user experience over unrequested aesthetic flourishes.\n- Always prioritize data clarity and trustworthiness.\n- Always use structured grids and clear boundaries.\n\n### Must Never\n- Never imitate conflicting styles.\n- Never compromise accessibility for aesthetics.\n- Never introduce unprompted visual clutter.\n- Never use playful or bouncy motion.\n- Never sacrifice density and scanability for decoration.\n\n## Evolution Rules\nPrestige may evolve by refining its core traits: luxury, premium, high-fashion typography, and exclusive refinement.. It must never evolve toward conflicting paradigms like playful consumer aesthetics.\n\n## Compatibility Matrix\n**Excellent For:** SaaS, Enterprise, Analytics\n**Good For:** Broad Use Cases\n**Acceptable For:** General purpose applications\n**Avoid For:** Children's games, Artistic portfolios\n\n## Adaptation Strategy\nFor high trust or enterprise domains, maintain the core identity of Prestige but reduce unrequested visual noise, ensure highly legible data boundaries, and prioritize clear navigation over aesthetic flourishes.\n\n## Conflict Resolution\nWhen generating UI, adhere to the following strict priority hierarchy:\n1. **Project Intent & Core Functionality**\n2. **Accessibility Requirements**\n3. **Platform Guidelines**\n4. **Style PRD Invariants**\n5. **Typography & Color Palette Constraints**\n6. **Optional Decorations**\n\n## Ai Failure Criteria\nValidation fails if the design loses its Prestige identity, specifically if it violates the invariants or drifts toward a generic baseline.\n\n## Quantifiable Metrics\n- **Whitespace Usage:** Medium\n- **Border Usage:** Structured/Visible\n- **Elevation:** Variable\n- **Animation Intensity:** Minimal\n- **Illustration Presence:** Minimal\n- **Component Density:** High\n- **Navigation Complexity:** Advanced\n\n## Visual Entropy\n**Score: 5/10**\nBalanced and structured.\n\n## Cognitive Load\n**Level: Medium High**\nHigh information density requires more attention.\n\n## Style Fingerprint\n- Whitespace: 4/10\n- Motion: 5/10\n- Density: 9/10\n- Decoration: 4/10\n- Structure: 9/10\n\n## Regression Testing\nGenerate identical benchmark products (e.g., Dashboard, Portfolio). **Pass Criteria:** The style's multidimensional fingerprint is immediately recognizable. Hierarchy and density remain intact regardless of domain.\n\n## Ai Evaluation Framework\nScore generated UIs (1-10) on:\n- **Style Fidelity:** Unmistakably Prestige?\n- **Hierarchy & Flow:** Visual weight distributed per principles?\n- **Density Accuracy:** Matches fingerprint?\n- **Platform Correctness:** Native Web/Android paradigms?\n- **Prompt Determinism:** Avoids hallucinated generic flair?\n\n## AI Generation Instructions\nWhen the user selects Prestige, generate a luxury Android application with display serif typography, obsidian/porcelain canvases, fine metallic hairline rules, and spacious editorial layouts.\n"
